{"4042340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aquachamber", "steam_appid": 4042340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poolcore Visuals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue-toned water, tiles, liminal spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loop Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene resets, clues accumulate, memory is your weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-Lock Puzzles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance only by analyzing and understanding the rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free observation, details hold the answers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Difficulty, No Hints, Pure Deduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by games such as <i>Outer Wilds</i>.</strong> Aquachamber is a first-person puzzle game where you constantly return to the starting point. Explore this mysterious space and use your logic to uncover clues—every strange phenomenon follows a hidden pattern.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mysterious Poolcore Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore within the mysterious poolcore space, experience the artistic styles and emotional atmospheres across different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.poster.avif?t=1776003231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.webm?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.mp4?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Exploration and Puzzle Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe the details of this world, and deduce the principles behind the things that make you curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.poster.avif?t=1776003231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.webm?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.mp4?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Horror Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquachamber might have some tense atmospheres, but it is essentially a puzzle game, not a horror game. There are no monsters jumping out at you or frightening elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.poster.avif?t=1776003231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.webm?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042340/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.mp4?t=1776003231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poolcore Visuals:</stro